        },
        {
          "text": "Rwodhe, bedi win ma witire i kite ma wikuro gine ŋecin mewin. Poyi win nike wibende winigi Rwoth mewin i polo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.4.1",
